              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.38+NUM.26.39+NUM.26.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 26:38-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.7.6+1CH.7.7+1CH.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 7:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benyamini yavyaye Bela, ni we mfura yiwe, uwa kabiri ni Ashubeli, uwa gatatu ni Ahara; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uwa kane ni Noha, uwa gatanu ni Rafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahungu ba Bela ni Adari na Gera na Abihudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abishuwa na Namani na Ahowa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Gera na Shefufani na Huramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ni bo bene Ehudi: bār’ abakuru bo mu mazu ya ba sekuruza mu baba i Geba; babajana ar’ inyagano i Manahati; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni bo aba: Namani na Ahiya; kandi Gera ni we yabajanye ar’ inyagano, ni we se wa Uza na Ahihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaharayimu avyarira abana mu gihugu c’i Mowabu, amaze kwirukana abagore biwe Hushimu na Bayara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avyarana na Hodeshi umugore wiwe Yobabu na Sibiya na Mesha na Malukamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yusi na Shakiya na Miruma. Abo ni bo bār’ abahungu biwe, kandi bār’ abakuru bo mu mazu ya ba sekuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abo yavyaye kuri Hushimu ni Abitubu na Elipali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Elipali ni Eberi na Mishamu na Shemedi; Shemedi uwo ni we yubatse Ono na Lodi bo n’ibisagara bihakūkira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elipali avyara na Beriya na Shema; ni bo bār’ abakuru bo mu mazu ya ba sekuruza mu bāba i Ayaloni, birukanye abāba i Gati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arongera avyara na Ahiyo na Shashaki na Yeremoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Zebadiya na Aradi na Ederi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Mikayeli na Ishipa na Yoha ni bo bene Beriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Zebadiya na Meshulamu na Hizuki na Heberi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ishimerayi na Izuliya na Yobabu ni bo bene Elipali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yakimu na Zikuri na Zabudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Eliyenayi na Siletayi na Eliyeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Adaya na Beraya na Shimurati ni bene Shimeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Ishupani na Eberi na Eliyeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Abudoni na Zikuri na Hanani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Hananiya na Elamu na Anitotiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ifudeya na Penuweli, ni bo bene Shashaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Shamusherayi na Shehariya na Ataliya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yareshiya na Eliya na Zikuri ni bo bene Yerohamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo bagiye baba abakuru bo mu mazu ya ba sekuruza, uk’ urunganwe rwabo rwagenda rukurikirana, kandi bāba i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
