                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 14:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Ulamu bār’ abantu b’abahizi bazi kurasa; bāri bafise abahungu benshi n’abuzukuru benshi, bāshika kw ijana na mirongwitanu. Abo bose n’abandurutse kuri Benyamini.",
          "type": "text",
